---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import Pic from "../components/Pic.astro";
---
<Base title="Pension Plan Administrator for Business Owners | Sterling Pension Group" description="Sterling Pension Group is a pension plan administrator for business owners. We design and administer Defined Benefit and Cash Balance plans.">

<Hero variant="home" photo="home-hero" imagePosition="70% center" kicker="Third-party pension administration" title="Pension plan administrator for business owners." lede="Sterling Pension Group is a third-party pension plan administrator. We design and administer Defined Benefit and Cash Balance plans so owners can move more of today’s income into retirement—without making the process feel complicated.">
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Find my plan path →</a>
    <a class="btn outline" href="/calculator">Estimate contribution room</a>
  </div>
</Hero>

<section class="wrap trust" aria-label="Highlights">
  <div class="strip">
    <div class="item"><span class="icon-circle sm"><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} /></span><strong>Complimentary first conversation</strong></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="icon-circle sm"><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} /></span><strong>Built for owner-led businesses</strong></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="icon-circle sm"><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} /></span><strong>Serving clients nationwide</strong></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="kicker">Contribution potential</span><strong>$250k+</strong><em>depending on your facts</em></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <div class="grid3">
    <div class="feature"><span class="icon-circle gold"><Icon name="target" size={26} /></span><h2>Strategic plan design</h2><p>for your real business</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><span class="icon-circle gold"><Icon name="clipboard" size={26} /></span><h2>Clear administration</h2><p>without the runaround</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><span class="icon-circle gold"><Icon name="calendar" size={26} /></span><h2>Long-term perspective</h2><p>for the life you want</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap section stack-lg">
  <div class="section-head split-head">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Two paths. One bigger picture.</p>
      <h2>Make more of the income your business creates.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>The right pension arrangement can help you shift more of today’s income toward long-term wealth. We help you understand the trade-offs and move forward with confidence.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="two">
    <a class="media-card" href="/defined-benefit">
      <div class="media"><Pic name="home-db" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 600px, 100vw" /><span class="tag">Plan path 01</span></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Defined Benefit Plans</h3>
        <p>A powerful structure for business owners who want predictable retirement value and larger deductible contributions.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Explore the approach <Icon name="arrow" size={18} stroke={2.2} /></span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="media-card" href="/cash-balance">
      <div class="media"><Pic name="home-cb" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 600px, 100vw" /><span class="tag">Plan path 02</span></div>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Cash Balance Plans</h3>
        <p>An account-based Defined Benefit structure that makes substantial contributions easier to visualize and track.</p>
        <span class="text-link">See how it works <Icon name="arrow" size={18} stroke={2.2} /></span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="wrap section stack-lg">
  <div class="section-head center">
    <p class="kicker">Why Sterling</p>
    <h2>Expertise without the distance.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid3">
    <article class="panel"><span class="icon-circle"><Icon name="layers" size={26} /></span><h3>Designed for higher earners</h3><p>Turn strong business income into a disciplined retirement strategy with room to contribute meaningfully beyond a standard 401(k).</p></article>
    <article class="panel"><span class="icon-circle"><Icon name="briefcase" size={26} /></span><h3>Built around your business</h3><p>We coordinate plan design, documentation, administration, and compliance workflows around the way your company actually operates.</p></article>
    <article class="panel"><span class="icon-circle"><Icon name="people" size={26} /></span><h3>A direct, human partner</h3><p>Work with the people who know your plan—not a call center. We make complex pension decisions easier to understand and act on.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="navy-split">
  <div class="copy">
    <p class="kicker">Administration that stays ahead</p>
    <h2>The details get handled. You stay in the loop.</h2>
    <p>A well-designed plan only works when the annual details are managed with discipline. Sterling supports the ongoing work behind the scenes—from census data and testing to participant communication and compliance coordination.</p>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} />Defined Benefit and Cash Balance plan design support</li>
      <li><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} />Annual administration, testing, and reporting</li>
      <li><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} />Clear communication with owners, employees, and advisors</li>
      <li><Icon name="check" size={22} stroke={2.4} />Coordination with independent Enrolled Actuaries when required</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="btn outline-gold" href="/administration" style="align-self:flex-start">View TPA & administration services</a>
  </div>
  <div class="photo-side"><Pic name="home-admin" sizes="(min-width: 760px) 50vw, 100vw" /></div>
</section>

<section class="alt"><div class="wrap section stack-lg">
  <div class="section-head center">
    <p class="kicker">A calmer way forward</p>
    <h2>Simple on the surface. Thoughtful underneath.</h2>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><h3>Start with a short conversation</h3><p>We learn how your business is structured and what you want retirement to look like.</p></li>
    <li class="step"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><h3>Model the right plan shape</h3><p>We work through contribution targets, employee considerations, timing, and design trade-offs with your professional advisors.</p></li>
    <li class="step"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><h3>Put the plan to work</h3><p>From documentation and onboarding to annual administration and reporting, Sterling stays close to the details.</p></li>
  </ol>
</div></section>

<section class="wrap cta-section"><div class="cta">
  <div><p class="kicker">Your next chapter starts here</p><h2>Make the most of the years you’re building toward.</h2><p>Tell us where your business is today. We’ll help you see what a better retirement plan could look like.</p></div>
  <a class="btn gold" href="/contact">Set up a complimentary call</a>
</div></section>

</Base>
